{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56337","headline":"谢客岩 · 姚揆","name":"谢客岩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不见古君子，空余旧林峦。\n翠色媚车马，爽气严衣冠。\n水天（《同治志》作「天水」）影交碧，松竹声相寒。\n（见上海图书馆据天一阁藏本所摄胶卷弘治《温州府志》卷二十二、同治五年刊齐召南纂《温州府志》卷四。\n）（按：陆心源《宋诗纪事补遗》卷八十八收姚揆此诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚揆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56337.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56337","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}